/go.apollo.dev/c/docs","To initialize Apollo Client, you must specify a 'link' property in the options object. \nFor more information, please visit: https://go.apollo.dev/c/docs","The cache-and-network fetchPolicy does not work with client.query, because client.query can only return a single result. Please use client.watchQuery to receive multiple results from the cache and the network, or consider using a different fetchPolicy, such as cache-first or network-only.","The standby fetchPolicy does not work with client.query, because standby does not fetch. Consider using a different fetchPolicy, such as cache-first or network-only.","query option is required. You must specify your GraphQL document in the query option.","cache.modify: You are trying to write a Reference that is not part of the store: %o\nPlease make sure to set the `mergeIntoStore` parameter to `true` when creating a Reference that is not part of the store yet:\n`toReference(object, true)`","cache.modify: Writing an array with a mix of both References and Objects will not result in the Objects being normalized correctly.\nPlease convert the object instance %o to a Reference before writing it to the cache by calling `toReference(object, true)`.","system / SharedFunctionInfo / emptyScheduled","system / Context / scope @205111","system / SharedFunctionInfo / resetLastWrite","system / SharedFunctionInfo / shouldWrite","system / SharedFunctionInfo / maybeHandleIncrementalResult","system / SharedFunctionInfo / markQueryResult","system / SharedFunctionInfo / markMutationResult","system / SharedFunctionInfo / markMutationOptimistic","system / SharedFunctionInfo / markSubscriptionResult","system / SharedFunctionInfo / resetResultCache","system / SharedFunctionInfo / read","system / SharedFunctionInfo / watch","system / SharedFunctionInfo / removeOptimistic","system / SharedFunctionInfo / performTransaction","system / SharedFunctionInfo / resolvesClientField","system / SharedFunctionInfo / broadcastWatches","sys